{"id":"n65551-14-6","stage":2,"title":"넘어가다 · 过","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n65551-14-6-1","ko":"이봐요! 거기 선을 함부로 넘어가면 안 돼요!","zh":"喂！不要随便越过那条线哦！","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이봐요!","meaning":"喂、请看这里","explanation":"이봐요：喂、请看这里","readings":[{"term":"이봐요","audio":"/audio/f84b073d86f6e1fe3d0c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"course:이봐요:1","senseId":"1","lemma":"이봐요","origin":"course-authored supplement"}]},{"text":"거기","meaning":"那儿，那边，那里","explanation":"거기：那儿，那边，那里","readings":[{"term":"거기","audio":"/audio/8c91c4ef7e321cf67426.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62258","senseId":"1","lemma":"거기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"선을","meaning":"线","explanation":"선：线；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"선","audio":"/audio/ca8a8225e4286f710068.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16246","senseId":"1","lemma":"선","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"함부로","meaning":"随意，随便，乱，大肆，恣意","explanation":"함부로：随意，随便，乱，大肆，恣意","readings":[{"term":"함부로","audio":"/audio/a57ea17b4197d3729e38.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72466","senseId":"1","lemma":"함부로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"넘어가면","meaning":"过","explanation":"넘어가다：过；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"넘어가다","audio":"/audio/c8ec62583dd73fe6463e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65551","senseId":"14","lemma":"넘어가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"돼요!","meaning":"某个事情不被允许。主要用于反问句，或和否定副词连用。","explanation":"되다：某个事情不被允许。主要用于反问句，或和否定副词连用。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"20","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"f84b073d86f6e1fe","term":"이봐요","zh":"喂、请看这里","audio":"/